<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes">
    <title>FAQ – SHINEX Learning Circle</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <style>
        /* ============================================================
           MOBILE FAQ PAGE STYLES
           ============================================================ */
        
        .mobile-faq-container {
            padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-xl);
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        /* ----- Page Header ----- */
        .page-header {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
        }
        
        .page-header h1 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin: 0;
        }
        
        .page-header h1 i {
            color: var(--purple-primary);
        }
        
        .page-header p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin: 2px 0 0 0;
        }
        
        /* ----- FAQ Categories ----- */
        .faq-categories {
            display: flex;
            gap: 6px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
        }
        
        .faq-categories .cat-btn {
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: var(--radius-full);
            background: var(--bg-card);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .faq-categories .cat-btn:hover {
            border-color: var(--purple-primary);
            color: var(--purple-primary);
        }
        
        .faq-categories .cat-btn.active {
            background: var(--purple-primary);
            color: #fff;
            border-color: var(--purple-primary);
        }
        
        /* ----- FAQ Items ----- */
        .faq-item {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .faq-item:hover {
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }
        
        .faq-item .faq-question {
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: var(--spacing-sm);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            user-select: none;
        }
        
        .faq-item .faq-question:hover {
            background: var(--purple-bg);
        }
        
        .faq-item .faq-question .q-text {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            flex: 1;
        }
        
        .faq-item .faq-question .q-icon {
            color: var(--purple-primary);
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        
        .faq-item .faq-question .q-icon .fa-chevron-down {
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .faq-item.open .faq-question .q-icon .fa-chevron-down {
            transform: rotate(180deg);
        }
        
        .faq-item .faq-answer {
            max-height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: max-height 0.4s ease, padding 0.4s ease;
            padding: 0 var(--spacing-md);
        }
        
        .faq-item.open .faq-answer {
            max-height: 500px;
            padding: 0 var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-md);
        }
        
        .faq-item .faq-answer p {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin: 0;
        }
        
        .faq-item .faq-answer ul,
        .faq-item .faq-answer ol {
            padding-left: var(--spacing-md);
            margin: var(--spacing-sm) 0;
        }
        
        .faq-item .faq-answer li {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        
        .faq-item .faq-answer strong {
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }
        
        .faq-item .faq-answer a {
            color: var(--purple-primary);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        
        .faq-item .faq-answer a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        
        /* ----- FAQ Category Badge ----- */
        .faq-item .faq-category-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.55rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            padding: 1px 10px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-full);
            background: var(--purple-bg);
            color: var(--purple-primary);
            margin-right: 8px;
        }
        
        /* ----- No Results ----- */
        .no-results {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-md);
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
        
        .no-results i {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
            opacity: 0.5;
        }
        
        .no-results h4 {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin: 0 0 4px 0;
        }
        
        .no-results p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
        
        /* ----- Search Box ----- */
        .search-box {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
        }
        
        .search-box i {
            position: absolute;
            left: 14px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
        
        .search-box input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 14px 12px 42px;
            border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-family: inherit;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            background: var(--bg-input);
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }
        
        .search-box input:focus {
            border-color: var(--purple-primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12);
            outline: none;
        }
        
        .search-box input::placeholder {
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
        
        /* ----- Contact CTA ----- */
        .contact-cta {
            background: var(--bg-card-secondary);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-md);
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
        }
        
        .contact-cta h4 {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin: 0 0 4px 0;
        }
        
        .contact-cta p {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-md) 0;
        }
        
        .contact-cta .btn-contact {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-full);
            background: var(--purple-gradient);
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: block;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .contact-cta .btn-contact:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
        }
        
        .contact-cta .btn-contact i {
            margin-right: 6px;
        }
        
        /* ----- Back Link ----- */
        .back-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
            padding: 6px 0;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .back-link:hover {
            color: var(--purple-primary);
        }
        
        .back-link i {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
        }
        
        /* ----- Alert ----- */
        .mobile-alert {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }
        
        /* ----- Responsive ----- */
        @media (max-width: 400px) {
            .faq-categories .cat-btn {
                font-size: 0.65rem;
                padding: 4px 12px;
            }
            
            .faq-item .faq-question .q-text {
                font-size: 0.82rem;
            }
            
            .faq-item .faq-answer p,
            .faq-item .faq-answer li {
                font-size: 0.8rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- ============================================================
    MOBILE HEADER (Built-in)
    ============================================================ -->
    <header style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6, #6a3dcf); padding:10px 14px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; position:sticky; top:0; z-index:100; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:4px;">
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; flex:1; min-width:0;">
            <a href="javascript:history.back()" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9); font-size:0.75rem; padding:4px 8px; text-decoration:none; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px;">
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i>
            </a>
            <a href="/" style="text-decoration:none; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;">
                <div style="width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:50%; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2); color:#fff; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:800; font-size:11px;">SLC</div>
                <div>
                    <div style="font-weight:700; font-size:14px; color:#fff;">SHINEX<span style="color:#fff;">.</span></div>
                    <div style="font-size:6px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); letter-spacing:2px;">LEARNING CIRCLE</div>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:4px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:nowrap;">
            <button onclick="document.body.classList.toggle('dark-mode'); localStorage.setItem('shinex-theme', document.body.classList.contains('dark-mode') ? 'dark' : 'light'); updateThemeToggle();" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border:none; color:#fff; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:20px; font-size:14px; cursor:pointer;">
                <i class="fas fa-moon" id="themeIconMobile"></i>
            </button>
            <a href="/login" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border:none; color:#fff; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:20px; font-size:12px; text-decoration:none;">
                <i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt"></i> Login
            </a>
            <a href="/register" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border:none; color:#fff; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:20px; font-size:12px; text-decoration:none;">
                <i class="fas fa-user-plus"></i> Register
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ============================================================
    MAIN CONTENT
    ============================================================ -->
    <main class="main-content">
        <div class="mobile-faq-container">

            <!-- Flash Messages -->
            <% if (messages && messages.success) { %>
                <div class="alert alert-success mobile-alert flash-message" data-type="success">
                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> <%= messages.success %>
                </div>
            <% } %>
            <% if (messages && messages.error) { %>
                <div class="alert alert-danger mobile-alert flash-message" data-type="error">
                    <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i> <%= messages.error %>
                </div>
            <% } %>

            <!-- ===== PAGE HEADER ===== -->
            <div class="page-header">
                <h1><i class="fas fa-question-circle"></i> Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
                <p>Find answers to the most common questions about SHINEX Learning Circle.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- ===== SEARCH BOX ===== -->
            <div class="search-box">
                <i class="fas fa-search"></i>
                <input type="text" id="faqSearch" placeholder="Search questions..." onkeyup="filterFaqs()">
            </div>

            <!-- ===== CATEGORY FILTERS ===== -->
            <div class="faq-categories" id="faqCategories">
                <button class="cat-btn active" data-category="all" onclick="filterByCategory('all')">All</button>
                <button class="cat-btn" data-category="general" onclick="filterByCategory('general')">General</button>
                <button class="cat-btn" data-category="account" onclick="filterByCategory('account')">Account</button>
                <button class="cat-btn" data-category="courses" onclick="filterByCategory('courses')">Courses</button>
                <button class="cat-btn" data-category="payment" onclick="filterByCategory('payment')">Payment</button>
                <button class="cat-btn" data-category="technical" onclick="filterByCategory('technical')">Technical</button>
            </div>

            <!-- ===== FAQ LIST ===== -->
            <div id="faqList">

                <!-- ===== GENERAL CATEGORY ===== -->
                <!-- FAQ 1 -->
                <div class="faq-item" data-category="general">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="q-text">
                            <span class="faq-category-badge">General</span>
                            What is SHINEX Learning Circle?
                        </span>
                        <span class="q-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p><strong>SHINEX Learning Circle (SLC)</strong> is a Nigerian-based online learning platform dedicated to providing accessible, high-quality education in technology, design, and business. We offer practical, industry-relevant courses taught by experienced professionals.</p>
                        <p>Our mission is to empower individuals with the skills they need to succeed in the digital economy.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 2 -->
                <div class="faq-item" data-category="general">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="q-text">
                            <span class="faq-category-badge">General</span>
                            Who can join SHINEX?
                        </span>
                        <span class="q-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>SHINEX is open to <strong>anyone</strong> who wants to learn! Whether you're a:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Student</strong> looking to gain practical skills</li>
                            <li><strong>Professional</strong> wanting to upgrade your knowledge</li>
                            <li><strong>Career changer</strong> exploring new fields</li>
                            <li><strong>Entrepreneur</strong> building your business skills</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>There are no prerequisites or age restrictions. Everyone is welcome!</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 3 -->
                <div class="faq-item" data-category="general">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="q-text">
                            <span class="faq-category-badge">General</span>
                            Is SHINEX completely free?
                        </span>
                        <span class="q-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p><strong>Yes!</strong> All our courses and learning materials are <strong>completely free</strong>.</p>
                        <p>We believe that education should be accessible to everyone, regardless of financial background. You can access all courses, classes, and learning resources without paying a dime.</p>
                        <p>We do offer optional premium services for students who need additional support or want to access extra resources.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- ===== ACCOUNT CATEGORY ===== -->
                <!-- FAQ 4 -->
                <div class="faq-item" data-category="account">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="q-text">
                            <span class="faq-category-badge">Account</span>
                            How do I create an account?
                        </span>
                        <span class="q-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Creating an account is simple:</p>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Click the <strong>Register</strong> button on the homepage or visit <a href="/register">/register</a></li>
                            <li>Fill in your personal details (name, email, etc.)</li>
                            <li>Choose your course and learning level</li>
                            <li>Create a password and submit the form</li>
                            <li>Check your email for a verification link</li>
                            <li>Click the link to verify your email and activate your account</li>
                        </ol>
                        <p>Once verified, you'll receive your unique <strong>Student ID</strong> and can start learning!</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 5 -->
                <div class="faq-item" data-category="account">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="q-text">
                            <span class="faq-category-badge">Account</span>
                            What is my Student ID and how do I use it?
                        </span>
                        <span class="q-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Your <strong>Student ID</strong> is a unique identifier assigned to you after email verification.</p>
                        <p><strong>Format:</strong> <code>SLC-2026-01-001</code> (Year-CourseCode-StudentNumber)</p>
                        <p><strong>Use it to:</strong></p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Log in to your dashboard</li>
                            <li>Track your progress</li>
                            <li>Access your enrolled courses</li>
                            <li>Contact support for help</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>Your Student ID is permanent and should be kept safe.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 6 -->
                <div class="faq-item" data-category="account">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="q-text">
                            <span class="faq-category-badge">Account</span>
                            I didn't receive my verification email. What should I do?
                        </span>
                        <span class="q-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>If you haven't received your verification email, please try these steps:</p>
                        <ol>
                            <li><strong>Check your spam/junk folder</strong> – sometimes emails get filtered</li>
                            <li><strong>Wait a few minutes</strong> – emails can sometimes take a few minutes to arrive</li>
                            <li><strong>Resend the verification email</strong> – go to the verification page and click "Resend"</li>
                            <li><strong>Check your email address</strong> – make sure you entered it correctly</li>
                            <li><strong>Contact us</strong> – if none of these work, reach out to <a href="/contact">support</a></li>
                        </ol>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- ===== COURSES CATEGORY ===== -->
                <!-- FAQ 7 -->
                <div class="faq-item" data-category="courses">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="q-text">
                            <span class="faq-category-badge">Courses</span>
                            What courses do you offer?
                        </span>
                        <span class="q-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>We offer <strong>10+ practical courses</strong> across various fields:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Cybersecurity</strong> – Learn to protect systems and networks</li>
                            <li><strong>Web Development</strong> – Build modern websites and applications</li>
                            <li><strong>Data Analysis</strong> – Extract insights from data</li>
                            <li><strong>Digital Marketing</strong> – Master online marketing strategies</li>
                            <li><strong>Graphic Design</strong> – Create stunning visual content</li>
                            <li><strong>UI/UX Design</strong> – Design user-centered experiences</li>
                            <li><strong>Programming</strong> – Learn coding from scratch</li>
                            <li><strong>Networking</strong> – Understand network infrastructure</li>
                            <li><strong>WordPress Development</strong> – Build WordPress websites</li>
                            <li><strong>Motion Design</strong> – Create animated content</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>More courses are being added regularly!</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 8 -->
                <div class="faq-item" data-category="courses">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="q-text">
                            <span class="faq-category-badge">Courses</span>
                            How do I enroll in a course?
                        </span>
                        <span class="q-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Enrolling in a course is easy:</p>
                        <ol>
                            <li><strong>Create an account</strong> – Register with your details</li>
                            <li><strong>Verify your email</strong> – Click the verification link</li>
                            <li><strong>Browse courses</strong> – Go to the homepage and explore</li>
                            <li><strong>Select a course</strong> – Click on any course that interests you</li>
                            <li><strong>Click "Enroll"</strong> – This will add the course to your dashboard</li>
                            <li><strong>Start learning</strong> – Access the course from your dashboard</li>
                        </ol>
                        <p>You can enroll in multiple courses and switch between them anytime.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 9 -->
                <div class="faq-item" data-category="courses">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="q-text">
                            <span class="faq-category-badge">Courses</span>
                            How does the learning progress work?
                        </span>
                        <span class="q-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Each course is organized into <strong>levels</strong> and <strong>classes</strong>:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Levels</strong> – Major sections of the course (e.g., Beginner, Intermediate)</li>
                            <li><strong>Classes</strong> – Individual lessons within each level</li>
                            <li><strong>Progress</strong> – Track your completion percentage</li>
                            <li><strong>Points</strong> – Earn points by completing classes (10 points per class)</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>Classes are <strong>locked</strong> until you complete the previous one. You must complete classes in order.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- ===== PAYMENT CATEGORY ===== -->
                <!-- FAQ 10 -->
                <div class="faq-item" data-category="payment">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="q-text">
                            <span class="faq-category-badge">Payment</span>
                            Are courses really free?
                        </span>
                        <span class="q-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p><strong>Yes, absolutely!</strong> All courses on SHINEX are 100% free.</p>
                        <p>We believe that quality education should not be a luxury. There are <strong>no hidden charges</strong>, no subscription fees, and no payments required to access any course.</p>
                        <p>We offer optional premium services (like registration assistance, design services, etc.) that have separate pricing. But these are completely optional and not required for learning.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- ===== TECHNICAL CATEGORY ===== -->
                <!-- FAQ 11 -->
                <div class="faq-item" data-category="technical">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="q-text">
                            <span class="faq-category-badge">Technical</span>
                            Can I access SHINEX on mobile?
                        </span>
                        <span class="q-icon"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p><strong>Yes!</strong> SHINEX is fully <strong>mobile-responsive</strong>.</p>
                        <p>You can access all courses, classes, and features from any device:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Smartphones</strong> – iPhone, Android, and more</li>
                            <li><strong>Tablets</strong> – iPad, Android tablets</li>
                            <li><strong>Desktop</strong> – Any computer with a browser</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>The platform adapts to your screen size for the best experience. You can learn <strong>anywhere, anytime</strong>!</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 12 -->
                <div class="faq-item" data-category="technical">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <span class="q-text">
                            <span class="faq-category-badge">Technical</span>
                            What is the AI Tutor and how do I use it?
                        </span>
